---
import BaseLayout from "../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About | Portfolio"
  description="Professional profile, education and approach as a Software Developer."
  lang="en"
>
  <article class="about-page">
    <header class="page-header">
      <p class="eyebrow">ABOUT ME</p>

      <h1>
        Software Developer focused on building useful and maintainable
        solutions.
      </h1>

      <p class="intro">
        I am a Software Developer with a Higher Technician qualification in
        Multiplatform Application Development and further training in Full Stack
        Development.
      </p>
    </header>

    <div class="about-content">
      <section>
        <h2>Professional profile</h2>

        <p>
          My experience combines web application development, databases, process
          automation, environment and systems configuration, and content
          management through CMS platforms.
        </p>

        <p>
          I have worked on both professional and academic projects,
          participating in different stages of development and learning to adapt
          solutions to the real needs of each project.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Education</h2>

        <div class="education-list">
          <article class="education-item">
            <h3>Multiplatform Application Development</h3>
            <p>
              Higher Technician qualification in Multiplatform Application
              Development (DAM).
            </p>
          </article>

          <article class="education-item">
            <h3>Master Full Stack Development</h3>
            <p>MasterD · Specialized non-official training.</p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>How I work</h2>

        <p>
          I am interested in understanding the problem and the workflow an
          application needs to solve before focusing on the technical
          implementation.
        </p>

        <p>
          Throughout my professional experience, I have had to research
          technologies, solve configuration and connection problems, work with
          different tools and adapt solutions to real-world environments.
        </p>

        <p>
          I particularly value maintainable code, clear solutions and the
          ability to keep learning when a problem requires new knowledge.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Areas of interest</h2>

        <ul class="interest-list">
          <li>Software Development</li>
          <li>Web Development</li>
          <li>Backend Development</li>
          <li>Full Stack Development</li>
          <li>Process Automation</li>
          <li>IT & Systems</li>
        </ul>
      </section>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .about-page {
    width: min(calc(100% - 2rem), var(--content-width));
    margin-inline: auto;
    padding-block: 4rem 6rem;
  }

  .page-header {
    max-width: 900px;
    margin-bottom: 5rem;
  }

  .eyebrow {
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    color: var(--color-primary);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  }

  .page-header h1 {
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .intro {
    max-width: 750px;
    font-size: 1.25rem;
  }

  .about-content {
    max-width: 800px;
  }

  .about-content section {
    padding-block: 3rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .about-content section:first-child {
    padding-top: 0;
    border-top: 0;
  }

  .about-content h2 {
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 4vw, 2.25rem);
  }

  .about-content p + p {
    margin-top: 1.25rem;
  }

  .education-list {
    display: grid;
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }

  .education-item {
    padding: 1.5rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    background: var(--color-surface);
  }

  .education-item h3 {
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    font-size: 1.25rem;
  }

  .interest-list {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
  }

  .interest-list li {
    padding: 0.4rem 0.75rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-pill);
    background: var(--color-surface-subtle);
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 700px) {
    .about-page {
      padding-block: 3rem 5rem;
    }

    .page-header {
      margin-bottom: 4rem;
    }

    .about-content section {
      padding-block: 2.5rem;
    }
  }
</style>
